\f0\fs24 \cf0 # \uc0\u55357 \u56960  LifeHub \'97 Unified Desktop Dashboard\
\
**LifeHub** is a clean, dark-mode personal dashboard built with Python and CustomTkinter. It brings your daily goals, habits, focus sessions, and calendar schedules into one lightweight desktop application.\
\
---\
\
## \uc0\u10024  Features\
\
- \uc0\u55357 \u56541  **Assignments & Goals:** Track daily tasks with interactive checkboxes.\
- \uc0\u55357 \u56580  **Daily Habit Tracker:** Track recurring daily habits with persistent saving.\
- \uc0\u9201 \u65039  **Focus Timer:** Built-in Pomodoro-style timer with custom hour/minute settings.\
- \uc0\u55357 \u56517  **Calendar Feed Sync:** Fetch real-time upcoming events from Canvas, Google Calendar, or Apple Calendar via iCal/Webcal feeds.\
- \uc0\u55357 \u56510  **Automatic Storage:** Saves your state automatically in a local `lifehub_data.json` file.\
\
---\
\
## \uc0\u55357 \u56549  Download & Run (No Python Needed)\
\
1. Go to the **[Releases](../../releases)** tab on the right side of this repository.\
2. Download the latest `LifeHub.zip` release.\
3. Unzip the file and double-click **LifeHub.app** to launch.\
\
